       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. OCCURS-TABLE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 MARKS-TABLE.
          05 STUDENT-MARK PIC 999 OCCURS 5 TIMES.
       01 COUNTER-VALUE PIC 9 VALUE 0.
       01 TOTAL-MARKS PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       01 AVERAGE-MARKS PIC 999V99 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 78 TO STUDENT-MARK(1).
           MOVE 92 TO STUDENT-MARK(2).
           MOVE 65 TO STUDENT-MARK(3).
           MOVE 88 TO STUDENT-MARK(4).
           MOVE 71 TO STUDENT-MARK(5).
           PERFORM VARYING COUNTER-VALUE FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL COUNTER-VALUE > 5
               DISPLAY "MARK: " STUDENT-MARK(COUNTER-VALUE)
               ADD STUDENT-MARK(COUNTER-VALUE) TO TOTAL-MARKS
           END-PERFORM.
           COMPUTE AVERAGE-MARKS = TOTAL-MARKS / 5.
           DISPLAY "TOTAL: " TOTAL-MARKS.
           DISPLAY "AVERAGE: " AVERAGE-MARKS.
           STOP RUN.
